v class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CTPhipps</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1356049-spoilers-cults-of-the-blood-gods-discussion?p=1356438#post1356438\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">1. I'm really impressed with the Church of Caine but stunned that it apparently has no ties with the Sabbat whatsoever. Indeed, seems actively opposed to it.</div> </div> </div> </div>Then who was the Guy talking to at the beginning? I Thought he was talking about leaving the Sabbat because he saw the &quot;True Word&quot; of Caine vs the defilement the Sabbat had brought it to?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2715-lian","name":"Lian","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5218"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-12-22T18:43:24-08:00","id":1356566,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CTPhipps</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1356049-spoilers-cults-of-the-blood-gods-discussion?p=1356438#post1356438\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">1. I'm really impressed with the Church of Caine but stunned that it apparently has no ties with the Sabbat whatsoever. Indeed, seems actively opposed to it. The Lasombra purged the old Cainite Heresy and now they're perfectly willing to do the same thing to the Modern One now that they've joined the Camarilla. The thing is, I'm not sure what the Lasombra issue with the Cainite Heresy is because it's not like most Lasombra BELIEVE in any of the religions they preach. That's the big difference between them and the Ministry after all. The Lasombra love using religion as a tool while the Ministry love it for itself.</div> </div> </div> </div>The Lasombra have always been flip-floppy when it comes to religion. They'll advertise themselves as puppetmasters, but as a clan they always exhibit an undercurrent of religious thinking. Why else would they gravitate towards the church, or create the path of night?<br /> <br /> As for the Church of Caine and the Sabbat, remnants of the Heresy did infiltrate and influence the sect's rites. Maybe the modern church wants to reclaim their holy rites from the Sword's debased practices.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23964-el-barto","name":"El Barto","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"84"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-12-23T01:22:03-08:00","id":1356606,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CTPhipps</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1356049-spoilers-cults-of-the-blood-gods-discussion?p=1356438#post1356438\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">2. The Church of Set update in this book is pretty good and explains more about what's going on with the Ministry than probably the entirety of the previous material to this point. I admit to being a bit disappointed as it implies that they're still believers in the Followers of Set's religion. I was hoping we'd find out they were worshipers of Eris, Satan, Loki, or whoever and not just going with the idea they were all faces of Set. However, I do like the fact the Orthodox Typhonists have managed to shoot themselves in the foot by being unwilling to compromise their faith.</div> </div> </div> </div>Please tell me that Cagliostro is dead","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"","name":"Guest","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/default_avatar_large.png","title":"","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-12-23T19:21:37-08:00","id":1356738,"title":"","content":"I think the biggest missed opportunity at re-branding the Setties was ditching the 'Set' aspect altogether and renaming them Followers of Typhon/Apep or something. They always drew a much more clearer inspiration from it and other Chaoskampf mythic monsters than the legendary Sutekh. Also, they should have brought up their ties with the Wyrm like in the earlier editions. Great crossover material.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25584-logoth\u00e9t\u0113s","name":"Logoth\u00e9t\u0113s","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25584_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"146"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-12-23T19:57:31-08:00","id":1356742,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Logoth\u00e9t\u0113s</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1356049-spoilers-cults-of-the-blood-gods-discussion?p=1356738#post1356738\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I think the biggest missed opportunity at re-branding the Setties was ditching the 'Set' aspect altogether and renaming them Followers of Typhon/Apep or something. They always drew a much more clearer inspiration from it and other Chaoskampf mythic monsters than the legendary Sutekh. Also, they should have brought up their ties with the Wyrm like in the earlier editions. Great crossover material.</div> </div> </div> </div>I don't think the Setites want to destroy reality. They're not Nephandi. So the Wyrm would have no appeal to them.<br /> <br /> I confess, I like the polytheism of the Ministry and hope they continue moving away from Set and snake gods altogether.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangt