[]},{"date":"2020-01-10T05:02:24-08:00","id":1360102,"title":"","content":"What I lament we can't see in the previews is the clan symbol for the Hecata. <br /> <br /> Out of all the clan symbols, the Giovanni could use an updated one the most IMO.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://blood-and-bourbon.obsidianportal.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Blood and Bourbon</a>, my New Orleans-based Vampire chronicle.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3110-false-epiphany","name":"False Epiphany","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3110_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"748"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-01-12T13:47:13-08:00","id":1360583,"title":"","content":"In preview #2 the book says,<br /> &quot;There will always be great mysteries in the world, and faith has provided millions, perhaps<br /> billions of humans with answers, and comfort where there are no answers to be found.&quot;<br /> <br /> Shouldn't that just be billions, or are there fewer people with faith in the World of Darkness?<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/490-omenseer","name":"omenseer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar490_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"987"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-01-12T13:52:29-08:00","id":1360584,"title":"","content":"I feel this book needs an homage to this scene given vampires and religion.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"videocontainer with-aspect-ratio videocontainer-horizontal\" style=\"aspect-ratio: 16/9;\"> <a class=\"video-frame\" href=